All scripture texts bundled in `data/bible.sqlite.db` are either in the
worldwide Public Domain or licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0), which explicitly permits redistribution in
any format:

1. Tamil Indian Revised Version (IRV) — தமிழ் (Books 1–66, `verses.text_ta_poc`)
   - Title: இண்டியன் ரிவைஸ்டு வெர்ஸன் (IRV) - தமிழ்
     (The Indian Revised Version Holy Bible in the Tamil language of India)
   - Copyright: Copyright © 2017, 2019 Bridge Connectivity Solutions Pvt. Ltd.
     (https://bridgeconn.com/)
   - Source: https://ebible.org/Scriptures/tam2017_vpl.zip (and https://vachanonline.com/)
   - License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
     (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)
   - Attribution & Redistribution Notice:
     This translation is made available under the terms of the Creative Commons
     Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0). You have
     permission to share and redistribute this Bible translation in any format.
     The original work by Bridge Connectivity Solutions Pvt. Ltd. is available at
     https://ebible.org/tam2017/ and https://bridgeconn.com/. No endorsement by
     the original licensor is implied. Any redistribution of this corpus remains
     governed by CC BY-SA 4.0.

2. Tamil Old Version (1871 Rev. Henry Bower Translation) (`verses.text_ta`)
   - Title: பரிசுத்த வேதாகமம் (Tamil Old Version, 1871)
   - Translator / Publisher: Translated by Rev. Henry Bower (d. 1885) and committee
     for the Madras Auxiliary Bible Society (published 1871).
   - License: Public Domain worldwide (published 1871; author died 1885; copyright
     term expired globally including under Section 52 of the Indian Copyright Act
     and US 17 U.S.C.).

3. King James Version (KJV, 1611 / 1769 Blayney Revision) (`verses.text_en`)
   - Title: Authorized King James Version of the Holy Bible (1769 Oxford Standard Text)
   - Source: https://ebible.org/Scriptures/eng-kjv2006_vpl.zip
   - License: Public Domain worldwide outside UK Crown Letters Patent (digital
     redistribution dedicated to the Public Domain).

4. Douay-Rheims Bible (1582–1609 / 1752 Challoner Revision — 73 Books) (`verses.text_en_drb`)
   - Title: The Holy Bible, Translated from the Latin Vulgate (Douay-Rheims,
     revised by Bishop Richard Challoner, 1749–1752)
   - Coverage: All 73 Catholic Canon Books, including the 7 Deuterocanonical
     books (Tobit, Judith, Wisdom of Solomon, Sirach/Ecclesiasticus, Baruch,
     1 Maccabees, and 2 Maccabees).
   - Source: https://ebible.org/Scriptures/engDRA_vpl.zip
   - License: Public Domain worldwide (published 1752; Bishop Richard Challoner
     died 1781).
